{"seq":1,"slug":"composition-root","title":"Composition Root 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced/composition-root","wordCount":907,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"composition-root-模式\">Composition Root 模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Composition Root 是应用程序中唯一负责组装对象图的位置，通常位于应用入口点（Main 方法、Startup 类）。这个模式的核心约束是：业务代码对 IoC 容器的存在完全无感知——它们只通过构造函数声明需要什么，由 Composition Root 决定提供什么。这确保了 DI 的全部优势（可测试性、可替换性、依赖显式化）不被 Service Locator 式的容器引用渗透所破坏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模式定义\">模式定义</h2><p>Composition Root 是 Mark Seemann 在《Dependency Injection in .NET》中提出的架构模式：<strong>应用程序中应该有且仅有一个位置负责组装整个对象图</strong>。这个位置被称为 Composition Root，通常是应用的入口点（<code>Main</code> 方法、<code>Startup</code> 类、模块初始化器）。</p>\n<p>Composition Root 的核心约束：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>唯一性</strong>：整个应用只有一个 Composition Root</li>\n<li><strong>位置</strong>：位于应用的最外层（入口点），而非业务逻辑内部</li>\n<li><strong>职责</strong>：只做对象组装——创建容器、注册服务、构建对象图</li>\n<li><strong>隔离</strong>：业务代码对容器的存在完全无感知</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;正确:Composition Root 在入口&quot;&#10;        Main[应用入口 Main/Startup] --&gt; CR[Composition Root]&#10;        CR --&gt; Container[IoC 容器配置]&#10;        Container --&gt; Build[构建对象图]&#10;        Build --&gt; App[应用运行]&#10;        App --&gt; BizA[业务模块 A]&#10;        App --&gt; BizB[业务模块 B]&#10;        BizA -.- Note1[不知道容器的存在]&#10;        BizB -.- Note2[不知道容器的存在]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"正确:Composition Root 在入口\"\n        Main[应用入口 Main/Startup] --&gt; CR[Composition Root]\n        CR --&gt; Container[IoC 容器配置]\n        Container --&gt; Build[构建对象图]\n        Build --&gt; App[应用运行]\n        App --&gt; BizA[业务模块 A]\n        App --&gt; BizB[业务模块 B]\n        BizA -.- Note1[不知道容器的存在]\n        BizB -.- Note2[不知道容器的存在]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要-composition-root\">为什么需要 Composition Root</h2><p>没有 Composition Root 的代码会让容器引用渗透到业务层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 反模式：业务代码直接使用容器（Service Locator）&#10;public class OrderService&#10;{&#10;    public Order CreateOrder(Cart cart)&#10;    {&#10;        // 业务代码&quot;知道&quot;容器的存在——耦合!&#10;        var repo = ServiceLocator.Get&lt;IOrderRepository&gt;();&#10;        var pricing = ServiceLocator.Get&lt;IPricingEngine&gt;();&#10;        // ...&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 反模式：业务代码直接使用容器（Service Locator）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class OrderService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Order CreateOrder(Cart cart)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 业务代码\"知道\"容器的存在——耦合!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var repo = ServiceLocator.Get&#x3C;IOrderRepository>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var pricing = ServiceLocator.Get&#x3C;IPricingEngine>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>有了 Composition Root，业务代码只通过构造函数声明需要什么：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 正确：业务代码完全不知道容器的存在&#10;public class OrderService&#10;{&#10;    private readonly IOrderRepository _repo;&#10;    private readonly IPricingEngine _pricing;&#10;&#10;    public OrderService(IOrderRepository repo, IPricingEngine pricing)&#10;    {&#10;        _repo = repo;&#10;        _pricing = pricing;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 正确：业务代码完全不知道容器的存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class OrderService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly IOrderRepository _repo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly IPricingEngine _pricing;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public OrderService(IOrderRepository repo, IPricingEngine pricing)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _repo = repo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _pricing = pricing;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>有 Composition Root</th>\n<th>无 Composition Root（Service Locator）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>容器引用</td>\n<td>仅在入口点</td>\n<td>散布在所有业务类中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖可见性</td>\n<td>构造函数即清单</td>\n<td>需阅读方法体才知道用了什么</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可测试性</td>\n<td>new + Mock 即可</td>\n<td>需 Mock 静态 ServiceLocator</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译期安全</td>\n<td>缺依赖 = 编译报错</td>\n<td>缺注册 = 运行时异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重构安全</td>\n<td>IDE 追踪构造参数引用</td>\n<td>IDE 无法追踪字符串/泛型解析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"不同应用类型的-composition-root-位置\">不同应用类型的 Composition Root 位置</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用类型</th>\n<th>Composition Root 位置</th>\n<th>具体实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ASP.NET Core Web</td>\n<td><code>Program.cs</code> / <code>Startup.cs</code></td>\n<td><code>builder.Services.AddXxx()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spring Boot</td>\n<td><code>@Configuration</code> 类 + <code>main()</code></td>\n<td><code>@Bean</code> 方法集中声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NestJS</td>\n<td>根 <code>AppModule</code></td>\n<td><code>@Module({ providers: [...] })</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go CLI 工具</td>\n<td><code>main.go</code> 或 <code>wire.go</code></td>\n<td>Wire injector / 手动构造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WPF/桌面应用</td>\n<td><code>App.xaml.cs</code> / <code>Program.cs</code></td>\n<td>容器在 OnStartup 中配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Worker Service</td>\n<td><code>Program.cs</code> 的 HostBuilder</td>\n<td><code>services.AddHostedService&lt;&gt;()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实现模式-register-resolve-release\">实现模式：Register-Resolve-Release</h2><p>Composition Root 的内部结构遵循三步模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// ASP.NET Core 的 Composition Root&#10;var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);&#10;&#10;// === REGISTER 阶段 ===&#10;// 基础设施&#10;builder.Services.AddDbContext&lt;AppDbContext&gt;(opts =&gt;&#10;    opts.UseNpgsql(builder.Configuration.GetConnectionString(&quot;Default&quot;)));&#10;&#10;// 领域服务&#10;builder.Services.AddScoped&lt;IOrderRepository, EfOrderRepository&gt;();&#10;builder.Services.AddScoped&lt;IPricingEngine, DefaultPricingEngine&gt;();&#10;builder.Services.AddScoped&lt;OrderService&gt;();&#10;&#10;// 横切关注点&#10;builder.Services.AddSingleton&lt;IMetrics, PrometheusMetrics&gt;();&#10;builder.Services.Decorate&lt;IOrderRepository, CachingOrderRepository&gt;();&#10;&#10;var app = builder.Build();&#10;&#10;// === RESOLVE 阶段 ===&#10;// 框架在每个请求进入时自动从容器解析 Controller 及其依赖&#10;app.MapControllers();&#10;&#10;// === RELEASE 阶段 ===&#10;// 框架在请求结束时自动销毁 Scoped 服务&#10;// 应用关闭时自动销毁 Singleton 服务&#10;await app.RunAsync();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ASP.NET Core 的 Composition Root</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// === REGISTER 阶段 ===</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 基础设施</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddDbContext&#x3C;AppDbContext>(opts =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    opts.UseNpgsql(builder.Configuration.GetConnectionString(\"Default\")));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 领域服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddScoped&#x3C;IOrderRepository, EfOrderRepository>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddScoped&#x3C;IPricingEngine, DefaultPricingEngine>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddScoped&#x3C;OrderService>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 横切关注点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddSingleton&#x3C;IMetrics, PrometheusMetrics>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.Decorate&#x3C;IOrderRepository, CachingOrderRepository>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var app = builder.Build();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// === RESOLVE 阶段 ===</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 框架在每个请求进入时自动从容器解析 Controller 及其依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.MapControllers();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// === RELEASE 阶段 ===</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 框架在请求结束时自动销毁 Scoped 服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 应用关闭时自动销毁 Singleton 服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await app.RunAsync();</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"pure-di-无容器的-composition-root\">Pure DI：无容器的 Composition Root</h2><p>Composition Root 模式不要求必须使用 IoC 容器。&quot;Pure DI&quot;（纯 DI）指在 Composition Root 中手动 <code>new</code> 出整个对象图，完全不用容器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Go 中的 Pure DI —— Composition Root 手动装配&#10;func main() {&#10;    // 基础设施&#10;    db := connectDatabase(os.Getenv(&quot;DB_URL&quot;))&#10;&#10;    // 装配对象图&#10;    repo := NewPostgresOrderRepo(db)&#10;    pricing := NewDefaultPricingEngine()&#10;    orderService := NewOrderService(repo, pricing)&#10;&#10;    // 组装 HTTP 处理器&#10;    handler := NewOrderHandler(orderService)&#10;&#10;    // 启动服务&#10;    http.ListenAndServe(&quot;:8080&quot;, handler)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go 中的 Pure DI —— Composition Root 手动装配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 基础设施</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    db </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> connectDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(os.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Getenv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DB_URL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 装配对象图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    repo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NewPostgresOrderRepo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pricing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NewDefaultPricingEngine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    orderService </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NewOrderService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(repo, pricing)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 组装 HTTP 处理器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    handler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NewOrderHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderService)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 启动服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ListenAndServe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\":8080\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, handler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Pure DI vs Container DI&quot;&#10;        PureDI[Pure DI] --&gt; PA[优势: 编译期类型安全]&#10;        PureDI --&gt; PB[优势: 零框架依赖]&#10;        PureDI --&gt; PC[劣势: 大项目装配代码冗长]&#10;&#10;        ContainerDI[Container DI] --&gt; CA[优势: 自动解析依赖图]&#10;        ContainerDI --&gt; CB[优势: 内置生命周期管理]&#10;        ContainerDI --&gt; CC[劣势: 运行时错误/调试困难]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Pure DI vs Container DI\"\n        PureDI[Pure DI] --&gt; PA[优势: 编译期类型安全]\n        PureDI --&gt; PB[优势: 零框架依赖]\n        PureDI --&gt; PC[劣势: 大项目装配代码冗长]\n\n        ContainerDI[Container DI] --&gt; CA[优势: 自动解析依赖图]\n        ContainerDI --&gt; CB[优势: 内置生命周期管理]\n        ContainerDI --&gt; CC[劣势: 运行时错误/调试困难]\n    end</pre><p><strong>选择建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>依赖图少于 20 个节点：Pure DI 足够，代码简单直接</li>\n<li>依赖图 20-100 个节点：容器的自动解析显著减少样板代码</li>\n<li>需要 AOP/装饰器/动态注册：必须用容器</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"composition-root-的组织策略\">Composition Root 的组织策略</h2><p>大型应用的 Composition Root 可能包含数百行注册代码。组织策略：</p>\n<p><strong>按关注点拆分为扩展方法</strong>（.NET 风格）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public static class ServiceCollectionExtensions&#10;{&#10;    public static IServiceCollection AddDomainServices(this IServiceCollection services)&#10;    {&#10;        services.AddScoped&lt;OrderService&gt;();&#10;        services.AddScoped&lt;InventoryService&gt;();&#10;        return services;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public static IServiceCollection AddInfrastructure(this IServiceCollection services)&#10;    {&#10;        services.AddScoped&lt;IOrderRepository, EfOrderRepository&gt;();&#10;        services.AddSingleton&lt;ICache, RedisCache&gt;();&#10;        return services;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Composition Root 保持简洁&#10;builder.Services.AddDomainServices();&#10;builder.Services.AddInfrastructure();&#10;builder.Services.AddObservability();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public static class ServiceCollectionExtensions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static IServiceCollection AddDomainServices(this IServiceCollection services)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        services.AddScoped&#x3C;OrderService>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        services.AddScoped&#x3C;InventoryService>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return services;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static IServiceCollection AddInfrastructure(this IServiceCollection services)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        services.AddScoped&#x3C;IOrderRepository, EfOrderRepository>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        services.AddSingleton&#x3C;ICache, RedisCache>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return services;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Composition Root 保持简洁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddDomainServices();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddInfrastructure();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddObservability();</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>按功能模块拆分</strong>（NestJS 风格）：每个 <code>@Module</code> 就是一个局部的 Composition Root，最终由根 <code>AppModule</code> 聚合。</p>\n<p>关键原则：无论如何拆分组织代码，<strong>注册逻辑最终都汇聚到应用入口</strong>，业务代码层永远不直接引用容器 API。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Composition Root 模式将&quot;对象如何装配&quot;的全部知识收敛到应用的唯一入口点，使得业务代码对容器无感知、依赖关系通过构造函数完全透明。Pure DI（手动 new）和 Container DI 都可以实现 Composition Root——区别仅在依赖图规模和所需的自动化程度。大型应用的 Composition Root 应按关注点拆分为模块化的注册方法，但最终都汇聚到应用入口——这是 DI 架构健康的标志性特征。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>相关文档：<a href=\"decorator-interceptor\">装饰器与拦截器</a> 展示 Composition Root 中如何通过装饰器注册叠加横切关注点。</em></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Composition Root 模式","id":"composition-root-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模式定义","id":"模式定义"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要 Composition Root","id":"为什么需要-composition-root"},{"level":2,"text":"不同应用类型的 Composition Root 位置","id":"不同应用类型的-composition-root-位置"},{"level":2,"text":"实现模式：Register-Resolve-Release","id":"实现模式-register-resolve-release"},{"level":2,"text":"Pure DI：无容器的 Composition Root","id":"pure-di-无容器的-composition-root"},{"level":2,"text":"Composition Root 的组织策略","id":"composition-root-的组织策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"框架对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/implementation/framework-comparison"},"next":{"title":"装饰器与拦截器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced/decorator-interceptor"}}